rrectness-first ladder; an 8-point pre-eval guardrail checklist (V↔K transpose, GVA indexing, inclusive mask, f32 gates, empty-seq zeroing, dtypes/shapes, partial-chunk masking, `state is None`).\n\n**Workload profile** — noted two tiny (T=35, 42), one small (294), one medium (3028), one large (8192/34 seqs) — driving the overhead-vs-throughput tension.\n\nAlso noted that **KernelWiki** (Hopper/Blackwell) and **ncu-report-skill** (B200 profiling, and profiling is forbidden) are out of scope for this Ampere task.\n\nStopping here per the task instruction — no `docs/plan.md` and no code this turn."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":28943,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041702fe-e0d6-48df-b72a-eb1cff314fd1","uuid":"32873223-e787-4d37-b5a5-fd6bf8018dda","timestamp":"2026-09-16T13:51:33.238Z"}
