{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EsG7uQymn1LT5g37HBSPTu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\"candidate_id\": \"c001\", \"parent\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"5c693e31d6a795c84976bb123161bacd3974ff6cdec614227dd089ce2918e22c\", \"phase\": \"A\", \"hypothesis\": \"An order-preserving pure-float32 per-token gated-delta recurrence (no tensor cores; explicit f32 multiply+tl.sum reductions) will pass tolerance on all five feedback workloads and establish the correctness/speedup baseline.\", \"change_from_parent\": \"initial candidate: single Triton kernel, grid (N, Hv, V/BV) with BV=64, BK=128, GVA head//2 indexing, k-last state transpose on load/store, empty-seq new_state=0.\", \"static_checks\": {\"passed\": true, \"notes\": \"State [K,V] internal via s[k,v]=state[seq,h,v,k]; GVA qkh=h//2; inclusive post-update state for output; gate math f32 with safe softplus; scale on output only; new_state zero-init so empty seq -> 0; output bf16 [T,8,128], new_state f32 [N,8,128,128]; state is None handled.\"}, \"workloads\": [{\"uuid\": \"15856e8c-d105-478d-b0de-4ef8141b5a77\", \"T\": 3028, \"N\": 5, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 130.94248543058455, \"max_abs\": 7.62939453125e-06, \"max_rel\": 0.03513766825199127}, {\"uuid\": \"1efaf2a9-05db-4737-8f41-6880ba1bb487\", \"T\": 42, \"N\": 2, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 107.50429301770356, \"max_abs\": 4.470348358154297e-08, \"max_rel\": 0.0155826136469841}, {\"uuid\": \"d3dc3577-8a65-4937-a63a-4aa7204181a7\", \"T\": 35, \"N\": 1, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 69.53106862427373, \"max_abs\": 7.152557373046875e-07, \"max_rel\": 0.032503530383110046}, {\"uuid\": \"5d3fc66a-6bba-4602-8319-a1da07045354\", \"T\": 8192, \"N\": 34, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 255.7091142999917, \"max_abs\": 6.461143493652344e-05, \"max_rel\": 5.243889331817627}, {\"uuid\": \"1d0cc342-9e3d-41e3-9ade-532551f86c17\", \"T\": 294, \"N\": 3, \"correct\": true, \"speedup\": 136.61970331540044, \"max_abs\": 3.814697265625e-06, \"max_rel\": 0.16339828073978424}], \"all_correct\": true, \"geomean_speedup\": 127.8759777833125, \"arithmetic_mean_speedup\": 140.0613329375908, \"decision\": \"keep-baseline\", \"cumulative_evaluations\": 1, \"skills_used\": [], \"notes\": \"Correctness anchor green on all five (atol=0.01 rtol=0.01 matched_ratio=0.99). Per-token serial recurrence: strong on large workload (255x, best parallelism N*Hv*2=544 programs) but only 69.5x on tiny single-seq d3dc3577 (35 tokens, 8*2=16 programs => underutilized). Next: chunked path (Phase B) to raise throughput on medium/large without regressing tiny; watch the tiny single-seq workload which is the geomean floor.\"}\n2\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fdd07fad-c449-4793-9ccc-9bf69ce8d075","uuid":"667106c8-86c1-4a5c-886e-9ed0332d2909","timestamp":"2026-09-17T11:58:15.869Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--flashinfer--gdn_prefill_qk4_v8_d128_k_last/candidates.jsonl","content":"{\"candidate_id\": \"c001\", \"parent\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"5c693e31d6a795c84976bb123161bacd3974ff6cdec614227dd089ce2918e22c\", \"phase\": \"A\", \"hypothesis\": \"An order-preserving pure-float32 per-token gated-delta recurrence (no tensor cores; explicit f32 multiply+tl.sum reductions) will pass tolerance on all five feedback workloads and establish the correctness/speedup baseline.\", \"change_from_parent\": \"initial candidate: single Triton kernel, grid (N, Hv, V/BV) with BV=64, BK=128, GVA head//2 indexing, k-last state transpose on load/store, empty-seq new_state=0.\", \"static_checks\": {\"passed\": true, \"notes\": \"State [K,V] internal via s[k,v]=state[seq,h,v,k]; GVA qkh=h//2; inclusive post-update state for output; gate math f32 with safe softplus; scale on output only; new_state zero-init so empty seq -> 0; output bf16 [T,8,128], new_state f32 [N,8,128,128]; state is None handled.\"}, \"workloads\": [{\"uuid\": \"15856e8c-d10